menu "Z1 app control server (TCP)"

    config Z1_CTRL_MAX_CLIENTS
        int "Maximum simultaneous clients"
        range 1 8
        default 4
        help
            Stock allows 4; every client may send every command.

    config Z1_APP_ESP_VERSION
        string "Mainboard part of the version the official app sees"
        default "0.1.13"
        help
            The app's `version` gets "version = <LPC FIRM_VER>.<this>", shaped
            like stock's "version = 1.1.3.0.1.13" (as captured; current
            Makera release firmware-z1/1.1.3.0113), so the app's update page
            sees a current stock version. Our own version is in the boot log,
            the console `version` and GET /ota.

endmenu
